  "body": "In the Main item parsing section, items 4 and 5 are:\n\n> 4. Set localState to be an empty [ordered map](https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ordered-map).\n> 5. Set usages to be an empty [sequence](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-sequence) of unsigned long.\n\nAs `stringIndices` is a local item like `localState` and `usages`, it should also be cleared here.",
